{"id":"10e6ac165c352cd8","group":"58","path":"58/batch01/58-df-short-exact.md","title":"Short Exact Sequence","display":"df-short-exact — Short Exact Sequence","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-short-exact","aliases":["58-df-short-exact"],"display":"df-short-exact — Short Exact Sequence","depends_on":["[[../batch16/58-df-zfc-algebra2-module-homomorphism.md]]","[[../batch13/58-df-module.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","[[../batch15/58-df-injective.md]]","[[../batch05/58-df-surjective.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-short-exact"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-short-exact</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-short-exact — Short Exact Sequence"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"25e593b1b8714c23\" href=\"?note=25e593b1b8714c23\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-zfc-algebra2-module-homomorphism.md\">../batch16/58-df-zfc-algebra2-module-homomorphism.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"ef3a5dd6825f0373\" href=\"?note=ef3a5dd6825f0373\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-module.md\">../batch13/58-df-module.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"8317eefb4572709e\" href=\"?note=8317eefb4572709e\" title=\"../batch15/58-df-injective.md\">../batch15/58-df-injective.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"9f8cb046321ba311\" href=\"?note=9f8cb046321ba311\" title=\"../batch05/58-df-surjective.md\">../batch05/58-df-surjective.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B,C,R,f,g\\in V\">\\(A,B,C,R,f,g\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Module}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Module}_S\\)</span> (fully structured module predicate; see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"ef3a5dd6825f0373\" href=\"?note=ef3a5dd6825f0373\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-module.md\">../batch13/58-df-module.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}\\)</span> (set-function predicate; see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Injective}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Injective}_S\\)</span> (injectivity predicate; see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"8317eefb4572709e\" href=\"?note=8317eefb4572709e\" title=\"../batch15/58-df-injective.md\">../batch15/58-df-injective.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Surjective}\">\\(\\mathrm{Surjective}\\)</span> (surjectivity predicate; see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"9f8cb046321ba311\" href=\"?note=9f8cb046321ba311\" title=\"../batch05/58-df-surjective.md\">../batch05/58-df-surjective.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ShortExact}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ShortExact}_S\\)</span> (short-exact-sequence predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}short\\text{-}exact} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{ShortExact}_S(A,B,C,f,g,R)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists +_A,0_A,+_B,0_B,+_C,0_C,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,\n\\odot_A,\\odot_B,\\odot_C\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\mathrm{Module}_S(A,R,+_A,0_A,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,\\odot_A)\n\\land\\mathrm{Module}_S(B,R,+_B,0_B,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,\\odot_B)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\mathrm{Module}_S(C,R,+_C,0_C,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,\\odot_C)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(f,A,B)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(g,B,C)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\forall x,y\\in A\\;\\forall r\\in R\\;\n\\bigl(f(x+_Ay)=f(x)+_Bf(y)\\land f(r\\odot_Ax)=r\\odot_Bf(x)\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\forall x,y\\in B\\;\\forall r\\in R\\;\n\\bigl(g(x+_By)=g(x)+_Cg(y)\\land g(r\\odot_Bx)=r\\odot_Cg(x)\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\mathrm{Injective}(f,A,B)\n\\land\\mathrm{Surjective}(g,B,C)\n\\land f[A]=\\{b\\in B\\mid g(b)=0_C\\}\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}short\\text{-}exact} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{ShortExact}_S(A,B,C,f,g,R)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists +_A,0_A,+_B,0_B,+_C,0_C,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,\n\\odot_A,\\odot_B,\\odot_C\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\mathrm{Module}_S(A,R,+_A,0_A,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,\\odot_A)\n\\land\\mathrm{Module}_S(B,R,+_B,0_B,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,\\odot_B)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\mathrm{Module}_S(C,R,+_C,0_C,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,\\odot_C)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(f,A,B)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(g,B,C)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\forall x,y\\in A\\;\\forall r\\in R\\;\n\\bigl(f(x+_Ay)=f(x)+_Bf(y)\\land f(r\\odot_Ax)=r\\odot_Bf(x)\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\forall x,y\\in B\\;\\forall r\\in R\\;\n\\bigl(g(x+_By)=g(x)+_Cg(y)\\land g(r\\odot_Bx)=r\\odot_Cg(x)\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\mathrm{Injective}(f,A,B)\n\\land\\mathrm{Surjective}(g,B,C)\n\\land f[A]=\\{b\\in B\\mid g(b)=0_C\\}\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>All three modules share one explicitly bound ring structure, and exactness is the set equality between the actual image <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f[A]\">\\(f[A]\\)</span> and the zero fibre of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g\">\\(g\\)</span>; no vector-space kernel operator or nonexistent injectivity symbol is used.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch16/58-df-zfc-algebra2-module-homomorphism.md","status":"resolved","id":"25e593b1b8714c23","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-zfc-algebra2-module-homomorphism.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch13/58-df-module.md","status":"resolved","id":"ef3a5dd6825f0373","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch13/58-df-module.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch15/58-df-injective.md","status":"resolved","id":"8317eefb4572709e","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch15/58-df-injective.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch05/58-df-surjective.md","status":"resolved","id":"9f8cb046321ba311","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch05/58-df-surjective.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch13/58-df-module.md","status":"resolved","id":"ef3a5dd6825f0373","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Module}_S$ (fully structured module predicate; see [[../batch13/58-df-module.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Function}$ (set-function predicate; see [[../batch16/58-df-function.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch15/58-df-injective.md","status":"resolved","id":"8317eefb4572709e","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Injective}_S$ (injectivity predicate; see [[../batch15/58-df-injective.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch05/58-df-surjective.md","status":"resolved","id":"9f8cb046321ba311","anchor":"ref-9","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Surjective}$ (surjectivity predicate; see [[../batch05/58-df-surjective.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"A,B,C,R,f,g\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Module}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Function}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Injective}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Surjective}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ShortExact}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n&\\mathrm{df\\text{-}short\\text{-}exact} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{ShortExact}_S(A,B,C,f,g,R)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists +_A,0_A,+_B,0_B,+_C,0_C,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,\n\\odot_A,\\odot_B,\\odot_C\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\\\\\n&\\quad\\mathrm{Module}_S(A,R,+_A,0_A,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,\\odot_A)\n\\land\\mathrm{Module}_S(B,R,+_B,0_B,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,\\odot_B)\\\\\n&\\quad\\land\\mathrm{Module}_S(C,R,+_C,0_C,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,\\odot_C)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(f,A,B)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(g,B,C)\\\\\n&\\quad\\land\\forall x,y\\in A\\;\\forall r\\in R\\;\n\\bigl(f(x+_Ay)=f(x)+_Bf(y)\\land f(r\\odot_Ax)=r\\odot_Bf(x)\\bigr)\\\\\n&\\quad\\land\\forall x,y\\in B\\;\\forall r\\in R\\;\n\\bigl(g(x+_By)=g(x)+_Cg(y)\\land g(r\\odot_Bx)=r\\odot_Cg(x)\\bigr)\\\\\n&\\quad\\land\\mathrm{Injective}(f,A,B)\n\\land\\mathrm{Surjective}(g,B,C)\n\\land f[A]=\\{b\\in B\\mid g(b)=0_C\\}\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"f[A]","display":false},{"tex":"g","display":false}],"bytes":1986,"backlinks":[{"id":"2e365ef412503e95","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"d8ff8ac112a08548","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt"